<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><img alt="QantasLetterheadUpdated" src="" style="max-width: 714.7100952148437px" title="QantasLetterheadUpdated" /><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Hello {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</span><br />
<br />
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">It was a pleasure speaking with you earlier today! I’m truly delighted to have had the opportunity to personally congratulate you on achieving <strong>Platinum One</strong> status.</span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><span style="color:black">As a Platinum One member, you now have exclusive access to the <strong>Qantas VIP Service Team</strong>. Whether you are at home or abroad, we are dedicated to ensuring every aspect of your journey with Qantas is seamless. Beyond managing your bookings and points upgrades, we proactively monitor your Qantas International travel, intervening where possible to minimise disruptions and keep your plans on track.</span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><strong>Your Platinum One Advantage</strong><br />
<br />
We are delighted to offer you a suite of benefits designed exclusively for our most loyal frequent flyers including:</span></span>
<ul>
	<li><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><strong>Premium Priority:</strong> Enjoy the highest possible priority for Classic Upgrades and exclusive access to Reward seats on Qantas.</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><strong>Share the Status:</strong> Spread the benefits by gifting <strong>Complimentary Platinum status</strong> to a family member or friend.</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><strong>Exceptional Rewards:</strong> Earn up to <strong>175,000 bonus Qantas Points</strong> each Membership Year.</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><strong>Effortless Planning:</strong> We waive booking fees on all new eligible Qantas bookings.</span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><strong>Experiences and Events:</strong> Exclusive invitations to experiences and events. Ensure your&nbsp;<a href="https://www.qantas.com/ph/en/my-account/profile">VIP Preferences are up to date.</a></span></span></li>
	<li><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><strong>Dedicated Support:</strong> Our team is available to assist you <strong>7 days a week, from 7am to 11pm (AEST)</strong>.</span></span></li>
</ul>
<span style="font-size:14px;"> <span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"> For a full exploration of your new privileges, please visit the <a href="https://www.qantas.com/">Platinum One Benefits Page</a>.<br />
<br />
Thank you for your incredible loyalty to Qantas. We are honoured to be part of your future travels and look forward to providing you with a world-class experience at every turn.<br />
<br />
Once again, welcome to Qantas Platinum One.</span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Warm Regards,<br />
&nbsp;<br />
{{{Sender.FirstName}}}<br />
Qantas VIP Service Team&nbsp;</span></span><br />
<span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif">Within Australia 1300 752 801<br />
World Wide &nbsp;+61 2 6122 1111</span></span></span><br />
<br />
&nbsp;</body>
